<title>JAPAN: Takizawa Ham - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takizawa Ham - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.58		vs	   17.36</p>
<p> Operating	   90 million	 vs	  315 million</p>
<p> Current	    105 million	 vs	  306 million</p>
<p> Net		   40 million	 vs	  126 million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.73 yen	  vs	   11.73 yen</p>
<p> Shares		11 million	 vs	   11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Takizawa Ham Co Ltd is a meat and ham producer.</p>
